    <section id="ai" className="ai-landing-section"><div className="ai-landing-top"><div><AIChip>Signal layer · always on</AIChip><h2>Your learning experience,<br /><span>powered by AI.</span></h2></div><p>Quietly working in the background to help you spend less time searching and more time understanding.</p></div><div className="ai-feature-grid"><div className="ai-feature-large"><div className="ai-feature-visual"><div className="ai-rings"><span /><span /><span /><Sparkles size={22} /></div><div className="ai-pulse pulse-a" /><div className="ai-pulse pulse-b" /></div><div><AIChip>Context-aware</AIChip><h3>AI tutor that meets you where you are.</h3><p>Turn confusion into a conversation with explanations shaped to your current lesson and mastery.</p><Button href="/ai-tutor" variant="dark" icon={<ArrowRight size={16} />}>Meet your tutor</Button></div></div><div className="ai-feature-list">{[{ icon: Sparkles, title: 'Recommendations', text: 'Know why this, right now.' }, { icon: Radio, title: 'Adaptive quiz', text: 'Difficulty that follows your signal.' }, { icon: Target, title: 'Study plan', text: 'A path that fits your actual time.' }, { icon: Copy, title: 'AI flashcards', text: 'Recall the ideas that matter.' }].map((item) => { const Icon = item.icon; return <div className="ai-list-item" key={item.title}><span><Icon size={18} /></span><div><b>{item.title}</b><small>{item.text}</small></div><ArrowRight size={16} /></div>; })}</div></div></section>
